{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1702.unity3d","item_key":"commands[1].text","source_sha256":"c05289bc8f714c6167958d4bb98481091ae3212e9b5eac2220d57779f86c3a07","ja":"背後にいるなにか","zh":"背后的某种东西","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1702.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"55984c471e6ca68407c68416d5235ee883b853be74a73a6c740cf3e87a7cc511","ja":"「次は『あなたの周りにいる霊を視ちゃいます！』\nのコーナーです！　ゲストはこちらのおふたり！」","zh":"「接下来是『帮你看出身边的幽灵！』\n环节！今天的嘉宾是这两位！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1702.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"a58208e0f071b703106906585ce29a8099f9c79c9a48759fd21444c6d4330998","ja":"こ、こんにちは～。霊能力者さんに視ていただけると\nいうことで、すごくドキドキしています～……。","zh":"你、你好～听说能让通灵者帮我看看，\n心里真是紧张得不行～……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1702.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"9bd13a10b9bad0a614105c1560ddb2bddc1936866b55dc4a487713e57687974f","ja":"私も、すっごく楽しみです♪\nよろしくお願いしま～す♪","zh":"我也非常期待♪\n请多关照啦～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1702.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"23485e4974246c318192bb6ca7bbb673f67e02455691186e1c77cd8aa1600ad2","ja":"「ええ。ではさっそく……む？　むむむむ？\nこ、これは……！？」","zh":"「好的。那么事不宜迟……嗯？唔唔唔唔？\n这、这是……！？」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1702.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"0ea16c8984c537a3a4446e398ab44174220ddeaf34e762b2f843417e6677ab31","ja":"えっ！？　あ、あの。\nもしかして……本当に何か、視えちゃったんですか！？","zh":"诶！？那个……\n难道说……您真的看见什么了吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1702.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"641f8fdcd935959a8dfcb9a44cf9921017195b329df101f7c518aa25ca97cae5","ja":"「ええ……あなたたちふたりの後ろに……\nとても強大な力を持ったなにかが視えます……！」","zh":"“嗯……在你们两人身后……\n能看到某个拥有极其强大力量的存在……！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1702.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"788a7bc38d4a07624e7ca6479884995526e87dd42a2400618d8be23d8f93522a","ja":"ええっ！？\nそれってやっぱり、霊、なんでしょうか……？","zh":"诶诶！？\n那果然还是……幽灵吗……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1702.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"10cd258feafd1d6d78ba998e68b9e3a39ad6bd1a278cfa3f55419a552c32cd66","ja":"「大きな……建物のようなものが視えます。\nふつうの霊とは違う、何かが……」","zh":"「我看见了……好像是一座巨大的建筑物。\n还有某种不同于普通幽灵的……」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1702.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"b683c548353ed948b789d025a5b0fc164d2422584cc653f24e04cb5e476b26ed","ja":"そ、そんな恐ろしいものが！？\nわ、私、いったいどうしたら……！","zh":"那、那么可怕的东西吗！？\n我、我到底该怎么办才好……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1702.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"603f293a14dd81259b94eaf6c9f8b6f861dc67b3aa42889933d29f5324daf481","ja":"わぁ～！　後ろって、このへんかな？\n私も視てみたい……。","zh":"哇～！　后排是这一带吗？\n我也想看看……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1702.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"04017b5083b1f293bff28051bce5508606d81b2f64bd9f043859f9d57081ab50","ja":"「きゃっ！　なに？　停電？」\n「うわっ！」　……バタッ！","zh":"「呀！怎么了？停电了吗？」\n「哇啊！」……啪嗒！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1702.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"9aad9b55a023ea7b7b1a7139a1d148d2c974ec308f22916de280641b5d5a2e7a","ja":"きゃあ～～～っ！？","zh":"呀～～～！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1702.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"2a2ff537d7f6db1be55975396c89cc1d7cefad295226afec5671d9ca40cd311d","ja":"あれ？\n暗くなっちゃった。","zh":"咦？\n变暗了呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1702.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"b2c68a91df90ab4fff3d471fae57161234d6a3b9a3523dfb4528fc198bcbb142","ja":"もしかして、私たちの後ろにいる霊が\nやったのかな？　お～い！","zh":"难道说，是我们身后的幽灵\n干的吗？喂～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1702.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"cd2dfff84566aad2869efa549b57b711ab03eabc5afb4401b6574aa77bd7ae64","ja":"ああ、待って、麗花ちゃん！\nお願いだから、私のそばから離れないで～っ！","zh":"啊啊，等等，丽花！\n求求你了，千万不要离开我身边啊～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
